            <div xml:id="m-3c34885d-7611-4286-b64a-29086a732de2">
              <lg xml:id="m-6cb29e7b-ec1a-407f-b402-8368aedfdd74">
                <l xml:id="m-ac556bcd-232b-4f07-9b3f-2cef66972030" facs="#m-5546d7e2-d701-48da-b09e-0ecfe17f1656" label="ambiguous">1040</l><l xml:id="m-e5804a35-b488-41d6-9a8b-0820f571d68b" facs="#m-1bfddcdc-3847-4301-b263-bda089268702" label="text-like">15th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-69e15188-e54a-4866-9d58-fae9f950724b" facs="#m-8f525c01-c77b-4a4b-9d98-2f284605d18f" label="lyrics-like">adji-ci-éntur vó¬ bis, dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-207fcaf8-e183-4cae-a6cd-544c4e0e7bf8" facs="#m-b2b87e6e-4b56-4f9f-a024-db855022262c" label="lyrics-like">cit Dómi-nus.</l><l xml:id="m-4ee739aa-941c-48bb-a115-52d69ef9daf9" facs="#m-e6ab3579-16f2-4f68-9ee2-e5ba2108384f" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-018c0496-38dd-4fd0-9c94-457d1c8fa49e" facs="#m-00d4991d-48e8-4317-9130-d0e4e2dac44c" label="lyrics-like">Uríficent semper et múniant ad perpétuae ducant salvatiónis</l><l xml:id="m-9f1025bc-f632-4d23-8ee3-ce8329a6299d" facs="#m-1b699b16-d047-496f-84bb-d148af5f39a0" label="lyrics-like">Ltua sacraménta nos, Deus: et efféctum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b29b2d46-5fa9-4f0d-ac85-1fe0e84d1a88" facs="#m-ef93d4d1-0cd8-40d3-9235-2d304af31d84" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-be7dca10-be46-4450-92c8-e70817fd40e1" facs="#m-fb2a4b43-3a02-4f8b-96be-06e00970d123" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-e64d9388-834a-4449-9024-15e9dd7f2061" facs="#m-80d51371-4a53-41dc-a359-d24c0f7f460c" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-6e0396fe-440e-4a90-be79-fad35321157c" facs="#m-cce3dfe3-ebc1-46bb-939e-0fb0877a7e3d" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.g</l><l xml:id="m-70b6e69d-669e-42ce-a991-83ec9255da5f" facs="#m-65bb615a-4ef3-4d99-9a27-87be4589109b" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-a58fc6cf-0202-4983-82c0-226c8b2973a7" facs="#m-b87652a0-43f0-4b85-9dd3-bf7bac6729e8" label="lyrics-like">et justí¬</l><l xml:id="m-d79e1028-f407-4bd7-a9a4-705a01b8422d" facs="#m-785a71ea-0961-4531-9f75-d071849e2144" label="lyrics-like">Uaéri-te primum* régnum Dé¬i</l><l xml:id="m-8b922bda-d86a-4d18-ad9a-cfcc9396dc43" facs="#m-8588b876-da87-4fbc-9d56-b67e99278b6b" label="lyrics-like">ti-am é-jus: et haec ómni-a adji-ci- éntur vó-bis, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-1ba15166-5a42-4c36-a44b-e103b4d89fd4" facs="#m-22fdac06-e910-42b8-8afd-6126d86e4506" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-a9f41b53-23ad-496b-954a-101fb99a5cd5" facs="#m-d04da10e-0de8-42cb-9008-35b72767102a" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. g. p. 207. — Prayer. Custódi Dómine. p. 1037.</l><l xml:id="m-f7c70fe5-1f56-4b93-93e4-bb464483cf82" facs="#m-19619dfd-957a-4927-ac56-95a6896c6179" label="text-like">The Fifteenth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-97ceea12-aa3e-491d-a799-743c7023657d" facs="#m-0b99325d-91b9-452f-9e39-8d7af88dd1ae" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-023f4cb8-3dfe-4fbe-9f64-93fdbdb93936" facs="#m-16dceb0b-b934-48aa-96f2-59fd453777b6" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-f863d98d-7f0e-4f72-b26b-fefc0c710745" facs="#m-206ca183-00d0-453d-a09a-7cc387c2e0b4" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-85e90210-648a-4721-80ef-a7230b6dcd95" facs="#m-3ca4c55a-b3ab-46e5-a281-9b67ad8fde0c" label="lyrics-like">Nclí-na, “Dó-mi-ne, áurem tú¬ am ad me,</l><l xml:id="m-2ffc6868-2bfc-4c14-8d04-480eb4d5664b" facs="#m-9e8b78e4-c75d-4f7f-bc1f-5a15e3b407de" label="lyrics-like">et ex- áudi me: sálvum fac sérvum tú¬ um, Dé¬ us</l><l xml:id="m-8c710eba-0c4e-47a4-8d28-1aadce1740dd" facs="#m-034b3baa-1f86-4097-b2a6-d50644f0ae25" label="lyrics-like">te : mi-se-ré-re mí-hi, Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-90218e66-8b63-4fec-883b-10cf32d32871" facs="#m-a4d265a6-8b90-4b79-8bdc-3a39721ccd7f" label="lyrics-like">mé- us, spe-rántem in</l></lg>
